      "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-pure-r/q6-solution-2.svg\" alt=\"16a + 8 = 12 16a = 4 a = 1 4 Hence a = 1/4. [A1] At t = 12, V = 12/4 , [A1] = 3 so the value is £3,000 . [A1]\" style=\"--madas-width:677.3px\"></figure>",
