      "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-pure-r/q8-solution-2.svg\" alt=\"(b) Starting from y1 = 0.3, the recurrence yn+1 = e−2yn−1/2 [M1] gives 0.332871, 0.311691, 0.325178, . . .. [A1] Continuing without rounding at each input gives y5 = 0.316524 y6 = 0.32205 y7 = 0.31851 y8 = 0.32077 y9 = 0.31932 y10 = 0.32025 y11 = 0.31965 y12 = 0.32003 y13 = 0.31979\" style=\"--madas-width:677.3px\"></figure>",
