    "id": "madas/alevel-pure-r/q10",
    "question": "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-pure-r/q10-question-1.svg\" alt=\"It is given that 3 sin3 θ ≡ 3sin θ − 4sin θ . a) Prove the validity of the above trigonometric identity. ( ) 4 b) By differentiating both sides of the above identity with respect to θ , show that 3 cos3 θ ≡ 4cos θ − 3cos θ . ( ) 4 c) Hence show that θ 2 θ − 3 θ 3tan sec 4tan tan3 θ ≡ . ( ) 3 2 4 − 3sec θ\" style=\"--madas-width:570.7px\"></figure><figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-pure-r/q10-question-2.svg\" alt=\"d) Deduce that 3 3tan θ − tan θ tan3 θ ≡ . ( ) 2 2 1 3tan − θ\" style=\"--madas-width:589.3px\"></figure>",
